1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Threatened by a ruthless demon, humanity was on the brink of destruction.

2
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:16,000
All seemed lost until a lone mage stepped forward and took up the fight.

3
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:29,000
After his triumph, he was hailed as the Wizard King, and his story became legend.

4
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,000
From far away, he was led by the path of the world.

5
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:40,000
The path of the world is broken.

6
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,000
The path of the world is broken.

7
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:49,000
You can't do it, everybody get down.

8
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:50,000
You can't do it, everybody get down.

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:52,000
You can't do it, step up, step up.

10
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Oh oh.

11
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Oh oh.

12
00:01:02,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Oh oh.

13
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,500
運命の凍らに I'm falling down

14
00:01:07,500 --> 00:01:10,100
君と彼女のハーモニー

15
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:12,800
生まれ過去に置き去りのまま

16
00:01:12,800 --> 00:01:15,300
君の強気の香りは

17
00:01:15,300 --> 00:01:18,700
丸心に引きずったまま

18
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:22,600
待ってるだけじゃも足りない

19
00:01:22,600 --> 00:01:24,600
Take through it now

20
00:01:24,600 --> 00:01:27,800
真っ赤に抱きしめ

21
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:29,900
Take through it now

22
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:33,200
明日しだスルエイ

23
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:35,100
Take through it now

24
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,400
光灯して

25
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,400
Take through it now

26
00:01:40,400 --> 00:01:43,600
真っ暗なメイロイ

27
00:01:43,600 --> 00:01:45,400
Take through it now

28
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:47,600
La la la la la la la

29
00:01:47,600 --> 00:01:48,900
La la la la la la

30
00:01:48,900 --> 00:01:50,600
Take through it now

31
00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:52,900
La la la la la la la

32
00:01:52,900 --> 00:01:55,400
目の前の希望掴まって

33
00:01:59,900 --> 00:02:04,200
There was one more piece of information

34
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:07,100
The Midnight Sun members revealed during their questioning

35
00:02:07,100 --> 00:02:08,100
Asta?

36
00:02:08,100 --> 00:02:11,900
Remember the hideout they took you to after you were captured?

37
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:14,600
And the mysterious stone tablet that was hidden there?

38
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:16,600
That thing?

39
00:02:16,600 --> 00:02:18,400
According to our captives

40
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:22,100
They call the gems embedded in that tablet magic stones

41
00:02:22,100 --> 00:02:26,700
They believe that gathering them will allow them to be reborn into their true forms

42
00:02:26,700 --> 00:02:28,400
With close ties to the mana

43
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,500
Thereby granting them immense power

44
00:02:30,500 --> 00:02:33,500
Four stones remain to be gathered

45
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:35,200
And from what our captives said

46
00:02:35,200 --> 00:02:37,400
It seems they know the location of one of them

47
00:02:37,400 --> 00:02:39,400
Hmm, where's that?

48
00:02:39,400 --> 00:02:41,700
The underwater temple

49
00:02:41,700 --> 00:02:43,900
One of the strong magic regions

50
00:02:43,900 --> 00:02:46,500
So, we have to get there before this

51
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:48,000
Eye of the Midnight Sun does

52
00:02:48,000 --> 00:02:50,000
And make off with this magic stone thingy

53
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:51,500
Is that the general idea?

54
00:02:51,500 --> 00:02:56,500
That's right, and I believe the best people for this mission will be found in the Black Bulls

55
00:02:56,500 --> 00:02:58,200
Who are unique among the Magic Knights

56
00:02:58,200 --> 00:03:02,200
Because of the number of its members unfettered by family or social standing

57
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:04,800
So, will you do it?

58
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:09,200
Looks like you didn't make it to the main dish

59
00:03:09,200 --> 00:03:11,300
Rest in peace

60
00:03:11,300 --> 00:03:21,000
For saving the underwater temple and its people, you have my gratitude

61
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:22,000
Thank you

62
00:03:22,000 --> 00:03:24,000
Thank you so much

63
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:25,000
All right

64
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:26,000
Got it

65
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:28,000
And now our mission's complete

66
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:30,000
Listen up, gang

67
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:33,000
Nice work

68
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:39,700
Having been assigned a crucial mission by the Wizard King

69
00:03:39,700 --> 00:03:42,700
The Black Bulls won a fierce battle against a terrible foe

70
00:03:42,700 --> 00:03:44,700
Secured the magic stone

71
00:03:44,700 --> 00:03:48,700
And returned home with all members present and accounted for

72
00:03:48,700 --> 00:03:51,700
You did such a great job, everybody!

73
00:03:51,700 --> 00:03:54,700
You're the one who wound up the most seriously injured

74
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:56,700
So...exhausted

75
00:03:56,700 --> 00:03:58,700
Hello, my angel

76
00:03:58,700 --> 00:04:01,700
Your big brother has completed his mission and returned to dry land

77
00:04:01,700 --> 00:04:05,400
I feel so much better just knowing you're breathing the same air again

78
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:08,400
Oh, that seafood was delicious

79
00:04:08,400 --> 00:04:10,400
My god, no good stomach, get for me

80
00:04:10,400 --> 00:04:15,400
There's nothing more satisfying than the first bottle or three after finishing a big job

81
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:19,400
Completing an important mission like this is a win for the whole squad

82
00:04:19,400 --> 00:04:21,400
Something this big should improve our standing

83
00:04:21,400 --> 00:04:23,400
Well, what do you know, guys?

84
00:04:23,400 --> 00:04:25,400
Guess it turns out we're not utterly hopeless after all

85
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:26,400
True, we've gotten better

86
00:04:26,400 --> 00:04:30,400
But considering our record, we're still dead last out of all the Magic Knight squads

87
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:32,100
Wait a second

88
00:04:32,100 --> 00:04:33,100
Huh?

89
00:04:33,100 --> 00:04:34,100
Huh?

90
00:04:34,100 --> 00:04:37,100
He wasn't with us, was he?

91
00:04:37,100 --> 00:04:38,100
Oh, crap

92
00:04:38,100 --> 00:04:40,100
I completely forgot about Gordon

93
00:04:40,100 --> 00:04:43,100
Hey, somebody talk to him

94
00:04:43,100 --> 00:04:45,100
He looks kind of depressed

95
00:04:45,100 --> 00:04:47,100
Nah, he's ticked off

96
00:04:47,100 --> 00:04:49,100
Just listen to the way he's mumbling

97
00:04:49,100 --> 00:04:52,100
I'm not so sure, isn't Gordon always mumbling?

98
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:55,800
It's creepy never having any idea what's going through his head

99
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:07,800
Gordon Agrippa

100
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:12,300
A lonely fellow who only wants friends but just can't seem to make them

101
00:05:12,300 --> 00:05:14,000
Looks like we're here either

102
00:05:14,000 --> 00:05:15,000
Huh?

103
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:22,000
Don't cherish the memory of them forever

104
00:05:22,000 --> 00:05:25,000
Okay, I get to go give our report to the Wizard King

105
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:26,000
Aught to be fun

106
00:05:26,000 --> 00:05:28,500
Charmy, you go grab the prisoners and come too

107
00:05:28,500 --> 00:05:30,500
Will I get a tree for God with me?

108
00:05:30,500 --> 00:05:31,000
Nope

109
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:34,000
Finral, portal duty

110
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,300
Will there be pretty girls?

111
00:05:35,300 --> 00:05:36,500
There won't

112
00:05:36,500 --> 00:05:37,500
Aww

113
00:05:37,500 --> 00:05:39,500
Marie is a perfect angel

114
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:42,700
I want to go with you, Captain!

115
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:44,200
Please take me!

116
00:05:44,200 --> 00:05:47,000
You know, you're a little too much of a go-getter sometimes

117
00:05:47,000 --> 00:05:51,200
The main thing you should be worried about right now is resting and getting yourself healed up

118
00:05:51,200 --> 00:05:55,000
Not that I'm even the tiniest bit worried about you or anything, because I'm not

119
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,200
Just do whatever

120
00:05:57,200 --> 00:05:59,200
What was that for, Noelle?

121
00:05:59,200 --> 00:06:02,500
Given those gnarly wounds of yours, you'd be better off staying put

122
00:06:02,500 --> 00:06:09,000
Although honestly, if I want to be fair, you were with me when the Wizard King gave us the mission in the first place

123
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:11,000
So alright, I guess you can go

124
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,000
Awesome!

125
00:06:12,500 --> 00:06:15,000
As for the rest of you, get some sleep

126
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,000
See you've got that covered

127
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:25,000
Oh, hey Nero, you're tagging along too?

128
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:28,000
That reminds me, I've been wondering about something

129
00:06:28,000 --> 00:06:34,500
That shiny thing you found back in Saucy Village kind of looked like the magic stone we got from the temple

130
00:06:34,500 --> 00:06:35,500
Asuka!

131
00:06:35,500 --> 00:06:36,500
Uh, yeah?

132
00:06:36,500 --> 00:06:38,500
Come on, we're about to leave

133
00:06:39,500 --> 00:06:40,500
Quit your dilly-dallying

134
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:42,500
Sorry, Captain Yumi

135
00:06:50,500 --> 00:06:52,500
Wow, it's just as crazy big as ever

136
00:06:52,500 --> 00:06:53,500
Shut up

137
00:06:54,500 --> 00:06:56,500
Okay, Finral, thanks for giving us a ride

138
00:06:56,500 --> 00:06:57,500
Huh?

139
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:59,000
We'll see you when it's time to head back

140
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,000
Hey!

141
00:07:00,000 --> 00:07:01,000
That's not fair!

142
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:03,000
I want to meet the Wizard King!

143
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:05,000
I thought I'd prove I could be more than just your chauffeur

144
00:07:06,000 --> 00:07:10,000
Although, if I'm choosing between meeting with the Wizard King and flirting with the local ladies

145
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:12,000
Actually, I'm good, see ya!

146
00:07:12,000 --> 00:07:15,000
Never fear lovelies, Finral's coming!

147
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:18,000
I see

148
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:21,000
So they did send someone to retrieve the stone from the temple

149
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:23,000
And you said that he was a member of the Third Eye?

150
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:26,000
That's right, the one they call Vetter the Despair

151
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:28,500
Sounds like a fitting title

152
00:07:29,500 --> 00:07:31,500
We'll examine the body here

153
00:07:31,500 --> 00:07:34,500
And interrogate the Midnight Sun minions you captured

154
00:07:34,500 --> 00:07:35,500
You scum!

155
00:07:35,500 --> 00:07:36,500
Yeah, okay

156
00:07:36,500 --> 00:07:40,000
Your binding magic is truly outstanding

157
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,000
That fluff is surprisingly strong

158
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:44,000
And who are you, Oka?

159
00:07:44,000 --> 00:07:46,000
Wow, Yumi, I didn't know you had a child

160
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:48,000
Look how big she is, though

161
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,000
When did this happen?

162
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,000
Whoa, not mine

163
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:52,000
Hey mister, do you have any yummy treats for me?

164
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:53,500
Look, just drop it

165
00:07:53,500 --> 00:07:54,500
Whoa!

166
00:07:54,500 --> 00:07:55,500
Oh, safe

167
00:07:55,500 --> 00:07:58,500
Here you go, one magic stone as ordered

168
00:07:58,500 --> 00:08:00,500
Hmm

169
00:08:00,500 --> 00:08:02,500
Thank you for this

170
00:08:02,500 --> 00:08:04,500
I know it wasn't easy to procure

171
00:08:04,500 --> 00:08:06,500
You've probably heard

172
00:08:06,500 --> 00:08:13,000
But there were many casualties among the magic knights who fought in Rockway

173
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:15,000
Now they can rest in peace

174
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,000
You did receive your share of injuries

175
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:21,000
But the Black Bulls completed this critical mission without losing a single member

176
00:08:21,000 --> 00:08:23,000
That's nothing short of marvelous

177
00:08:23,000 --> 00:08:26,500
And somewhere along the line

178
00:08:26,500 --> 00:08:28,500
You grew stronger yourself

179
00:08:28,500 --> 00:08:30,500
Yumi

180
00:08:34,500 --> 00:08:37,500
I understand you've made that foreigner a magic knight

181
00:08:37,500 --> 00:08:40,500
Honestly, what is Captain Julius thinking?

182
00:08:43,500 --> 00:08:46,500
Making someone like him a magic knight captain?

183
00:08:46,500 --> 00:08:48,500
Has the Wizard King gone mad?

184
00:08:48,500 --> 00:08:54,000
You're kind of weird, aren't you, mister?

185
00:08:58,000 --> 00:08:59,000
You've done well

186
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:03,000
I'm so proud of the amazing magic knight captain you've become

187
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,000
Truly

188
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:08,000
I'm 28, not 12, so cut it out, will you?

189
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,000
You're embarrassing me

190
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:12,000
Yes, of course, sorry about that

191
00:09:14,000 --> 00:09:16,000
Tell me if you remember this little quote

192
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:19,500
If you want to say you're right, get results from doing things your way

193
00:09:20,500 --> 00:09:21,500
Well, Julius

194
00:09:21,500 --> 00:09:23,500
Those were your words

195
00:09:24,500 --> 00:09:26,500
Just like I told you before we left

196
00:09:26,500 --> 00:09:29,500
I accepted that mission to prove that you weren't wrong

197
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:31,500
That you hadn't made any mistakes

198
00:09:33,500 --> 00:09:36,500
The way they fought against that monster back in the underwater temple

199
00:09:37,500 --> 00:09:40,500
My squad members proved that I wasn't wrong either

200
00:09:43,500 --> 00:09:44,500
Yes

201
00:09:44,500 --> 00:09:48,000
And Asta

202
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:51,000
You've had another impressive showing, young man

203
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:52,000
You're doing well

204
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:54,000
Very well, in fact

205
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:59,000
I expect we'll see a lot more from you

206
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:00,000
Thank you, sir

207
00:10:00,000 --> 00:10:02,000
Um, there was something I was wondering

208
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,000
I know you're super busy

209
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,000
And I don't want to bother you

210
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:06,000
But I was hoping that maybe

211
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:07,000
Of course, what is it?

212
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:09,000
Well, if it isn't too much trouble

213
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:11,000
Sir, could I have your autograph, please?

214
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:11,500
Please

215
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:15,500
Tell you what, you can have mine on your face

216
00:10:15,500 --> 00:10:16,500
No, please

217
00:10:16,500 --> 00:10:17,500
Thank you

218
00:10:17,500 --> 00:10:19,000
Don't be nervous around me for-

219
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:23,000
Please forgive the intrusion, sir, but it's important

220
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,000
Hey, Mushroom Head

221
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:27,000
I've told you before, it's-

222
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:28,000
You know what? Never mind

223
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,500
Now's not the time for this

224
00:10:29,500 --> 00:10:31,000
Go on, Marks, what is it?

225
00:10:31,000 --> 00:10:34,500
It's Kitan, a border village in sight of frequent skirmishes with the Diamonds Kingdom

226
00:10:34,500 --> 00:10:37,500
A Diamond Unit is attacking it as we speak

227
00:10:37,500 --> 00:10:41,000
Of course, they had to strike now

228
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,000
So many

229
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,000
Whoa!

230
00:10:52,000 --> 00:10:54,000
That looks like a whole army of them!

231
00:11:07,500 --> 00:11:14,000
This is a far cry from our usual skirmishing

232
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:17,000
Especially when you consider those who appear to be in command

233
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:18,000
Yes

234
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:19,000
Lagas

235
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:20,000
Brox

236
00:11:20,000 --> 00:11:21,000
And Yagos

237
00:11:22,000 --> 00:11:24,000
Three of the eight Shining Generals

238
00:11:24,000 --> 00:11:27,000
The eight Shining Generals? I've never heard of them before

239
00:11:27,000 --> 00:11:30,000
They're the eight most powerful people in the whole Diamond Kingdom

240
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:36,000
You might think of them as being kind of like our Magic Knight Captains

241
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:38,000
That's super not good

242
00:11:38,500 --> 00:11:39,500
Worse

243
00:11:39,500 --> 00:11:42,000
Kitan is the linchpin of our Border Defense

244
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:45,500
If we lose it, we'll be wide open to a Diamond Kingdom invasion

245
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,500
The time has come

246
00:11:49,500 --> 00:11:53,000
This battle could alter the course of the Diamond Kingdom's history

247
00:11:54,500 --> 00:11:57,000
A big battle, it's been far too long

248
00:11:57,000 --> 00:11:58,500
How very exciting

249
00:12:00,500 --> 00:12:04,500
We'll crush these Clover Kingdom weaklings and take their precious Border Town

250
00:12:04,500 --> 00:12:07,000
The little maggots don't stand a chance

251
00:12:07,000 --> 00:12:13,000
Our spies informed us that the Clover Kingdom had been worn down by the continued conflict with the Eye of the Midnight Sun

252
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:15,500
And that Border Security was then on the ground as a result

253
00:12:15,500 --> 00:12:17,000
It seems they were correct

254
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:21,000
We just need to take control of Kitan and then we'll have the upper hand

255
00:12:21,000 --> 00:12:22,500
Let's get started already

256
00:12:24,000 --> 00:12:26,500
This area has a wealth of resources too

257
00:12:26,500 --> 00:12:29,000
The fact that's lost on those Clover Kingdom fools

258
00:12:31,500 --> 00:12:32,500
Prepare yourselves

259
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:35,000
The Diamond Kingdom is attacking

260
00:12:35,500 --> 00:12:37,000
On your honor as Magic Knights

261
00:12:37,500 --> 00:12:39,000
Prevent their invasion at any cost

262
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:40,500
Sir!

263
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:43,500
Deploy the Magic Barrier

264
00:12:43,500 --> 00:12:54,000
I have 50 mages pouring their magic power into this barrier

265
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:56,000
You aren't going to break through it easily

266
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:59,000
None of your attacks will be able to reach us

267
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:02,000
But our attacks can pass through without a problem

268
00:13:04,000 --> 00:13:06,500
Our first target is that Lightning Magic Wielder

269
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:07,500
Logus

270
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:09,000
Pick him up

271
00:13:09,000 --> 00:13:09,500
Give up

272
00:13:18,500 --> 00:13:21,500
